 "u10d6.e1": {"pick": 3, "second": "", "note": "Same frame as u10t.13: 実力（からいうと）, then who is best suited or who will win, with にとって as a distractor in both."},
 "u10d6.e2": {"pick": 2, "second": "", "note": "からいうと is ruled out because it does not normally take a bare person noun, and 見える at the end also points to から見ると. Some speakers do say プロからいうと colloquially, so this distractor is a little weak, but the key is clear."},
